how off. They end up getting in deeper than they expected, and need to bring out their big guns. Many times, in the heat of the moment - like a tense fight - they accrue Paradox points one after the other. It always seems worth the cost, at the time, because the cost seems so low at any given moment. They can handle a few points, right? One more slice of cake couldn't hurt.<br /> <br /> Again, the dangers of Hubris.</div> </div> </div> </div>The best part is the whole mentality of &quot;just one more&quot; which occurs right before an almighty botch after 7 or so rounds of building the effect. 10 points in one felt swoop, be prepared to grow fingers out of your ears.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/mage-the-ascension/959615-chronicle-report-keepers-of-the-wyck\" target=\"_blank\">Keepers of the Wyck: A Chronicle I'm running</a> FINALE: Chapter 39: Green Fairy","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12193-saikou","name":"Saikou","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12193_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1406"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-02-12T17:21:39-08:00","id":1047994,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Saikou</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/mage-the-ascension/1047156-what-exactly-determines-vulgarity-heart-attack-and-similar?p=1047983#post1047983\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon